# Telos, the old military base (TSL, 232TEL), as far as the reactor: Bao-
# Dur's fist through the force fields, the turrets and the base's droids,
# the security control (the poison grates off), his Security on the
# security doors, the reactor started (its turrets turn hostile). Not yet:
# the codes' datapad, the bay control, the tank droid and the shuttle out
# to the polar plateau. Starts from the Czerka site's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @telos_military_base data/routes/tsl/telos_military_base.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Old Military Base" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
to TelosDoorFirst    # the party together at the first force field, for
gather               # Bao-Dur's fist (he must stand within 10 m)
use TelosDoorFirst
talk
use TurretA1         # the four turrets beyond, shot down (DSimpson: XP
use TurretA2         # for the fight, none for the console)
use TurretA3
say Slice into security terminal # the fourth, out of the room's sight,
say Deactivate local turrets # turned off at the room's console ([Computer])
use TermSA
talk
leader 1             # the next force field: Bao-Dur strikes it himself
bash TelosDoor2@8    # (DSimpson: switch to Bao-Dur; a_ffield_baodur opens
leader player        # it to his blow)
save telos_base_halls
fight 30             # the droids in the hall and the side passages
leader 1             # Bao-Dur leads through the force fields, each to his
bash TelosDoor2@5    # blow: the turrets' room's, its six droids and turrets
fight 30             # fought (the workbench beside), the shuttle hangar's,
bash TelosDoor2@6    # and down the lower passage the one to the left
bash TelosDoor2@7
leader player
say Turn off the security gas vents # the security control: the poison
use Security         # grates off
talk
save telos_base_security
leader 1             # Bao-Dur leads to the reactor: his Security on the
unlock TelosDoor3@1  # security doors (DC 28), his blow on the force fields,
fight 30             # the droids fought on the way
bash TelosDoor2@2
fight 30
unlock TelosDoor3@2
fight 30
unlock TelosDoor3@4
fight 30
bash TelosDoor2@1
fight 30
bash TelosDoor2@4
fight 30
bash TelosDoor2@3
use Reactor          # the reactor started: its turrets turn hostile
talk
fight 30
save telos_reactor
